a8-db0e-11ef-8713-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鄧州","place_name_jianti_auto":"邓州","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"97b766a9-db0e-11ef-9879-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"南阳县","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"97b766aa-db0e-11ef-af7c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"97b766ab-db0e-11ef-9e62-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"天祿閤","place_name_jianti_auto":"天禄合","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"97b766ac-db0e-11ef-af6a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：天祿，獸也。按今鄧州南陽縣北有宗資碑，旁有兩石獸，鐫其膊，一曰天祿，一曰辟邪；此卽天祿、辟邪，並獸名也。漢有天祿閤，亦因獸以立名。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：天禄，兽也。按今邓州南阳县北有宗资碑，旁有两石兽，镌其膊，一曰天禄，一曰辟邪；此即天禄、辟邪，并兽名也。汉有天禄合，亦因兽以立名。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"97b766a7-db0e-11ef-ab71-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"97b766af-db0e-11ef-b447-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：翻車，設機車以引水。渴烏，爲曲桶，以氣引水上也。車，尺遮翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：翻车，设机车以引水。渴乌，为曲桶，以气引水上也。车，尺遮翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"97b766ae-db0e-11ef-9013-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"宫廷事务","official_name":"鉤盾令","official_note":"鉤盾令是汉代官职，负责管理皇家园林、苑囿等事务，属于少府管辖。在《资治通鉴》此段中，鉤盾令宋典被派遣修缮南宫玉堂，体现了其在宫廷建筑维护方面的职能。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"帝使鉤盾令宋典脩南宮玉堂","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"71b7af04-37cd-4e46-8d1b-6132519726b4"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"宫廷事务","official_name":"掖庭令","official_note":"掖庭令是汉代官职，掌管后宫事务，包括宫女、工匠等，也属于少府管辖。在《资治通鉴》此段中，掖庭令畢嵐被派遣铸造铜人，显示了其在宫廷手工艺或工程方面的职责。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"又使掖庭令畢嵐鑄四銅人","start_index":15,"to