脩南宮玉堂，又使掖庭令畢嵐鑄四銅人，又鑄四鐘，皆受二千斛。又鑄天祿、蝦蟆吐水於平門外橋東，轉水入宮。又作翻車、渴烏，施於橋西，用灑南北郊路，以爲可省百姓灑道之費。","content_fanyi":"孝灵皇帝命钩盾令宋典修建南宫中的玉堂殿，又派掖庭令毕岚铸造四个铜人，再铸四口铜钟，铜人与铜钟的容量均为二千斛。又铸造天禄兽和蛤蟆，安放在平门外桥东吐水，使水转流进入皇宫。又制作翻车和渴乌，设置在桥西，用来喷洒南北郊外的道路，认为这样可以节省百姓洒水泼道的费用。","content_jianti_auto":"5帝使钩盾令宋典修南宫玉堂，又使掖庭令毕岚铸四铜人，又铸四钟，皆受二千斛。又铸天禄、虾蟆吐水于平门外桥东，转水入宫。又作翻车、渴乌，施于桥西，用洒南北郊路，以为可省百姓洒道之费。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":5058,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"97b7669d-db0e-11ef-a6dd-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"6五月，壬辰晦，日有食之。","content_fanyi":"五月三十日壬辰，正值月末晦日，发生日食。","content_jianti_auto":"6五月，壬辰晦，日有食之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":5059,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"97b766b5-db0e-11ef-a82b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"荊州刺史","official_note":"荊州刺史是漢代地方行政官職，負責荊州地區的治理和軍事，此處王敏擔任此職，率軍討伐趙慈。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"荊州刺史王敏討趙慈","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"57bdca63-5bf9-44ec-b7a9-51d8b34f1d07"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":189,"link_td_description":"王叡，字通耀，一作王敏（避曹叡讳），琅邪郡临沂县（今山东省临沂市）人，东汉官员。","link_td_id":"Q10000494","link_td_number_id":208225,"people_name":"王敏","people_name_jianti_auto":"王敏","people_xingming":"王敏","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"97b766b7-db0e-11ef-b777-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":186,"link_td_description":"赵慈，东汉末年的军士。","link_td_id":"Q10007705","link_td_number_